。幹等还守壶关，连战，斩首。幹坚守，未下；会太祖自征之，乃拔。太祖征管承，军淳于。遣进〔与〕李典击之。承破走，逃入海岛，海滨平。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":57,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":227,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-b-7a694d8a64abc7584ee6","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-7a694d8a64abc7584ee6","layer":"modern","quote":"〖2〗十一年：建安十一年（公元206）。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a18f1a1fe780e4c92d19","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o008","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-cb2469c06cb18878c8aa","layer":"original","quote":"十一年〖2〗，督孙瑜等讨麻、保二屯〖3〗，枭其渠帅〖4〗，囚俘万余口。还备（官）〔宫〕亭〖5〗。江夏太守黄祖遣将邓龙，将兵数千人入柴桑；瑜追讨击，生虏龙送吴。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":33,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
